# NOT read by the build. `./singularity build` formats through
# `@plugins/framework/plugins/tooling/plugins/format/core`, whose authority is
# FORMATTABLE_EXTENSIONS + the hardcoded PRETTIER_OPTIONS object in
# `core/internal/prettier.ts` — resolveConfig() is deliberately never called, so
# the writer and the in-sync checkers produce byte-identical output by
# construction. `.prettierignore` is likewise not honored.
#
# This file exists ONLY so editors agree with the build. It is empty (prettier
# defaults) because that is what the options object encodes; if the two ever
# disagree, the options object wins and this file is the bug.
{}
